# The network adapters and the Wi-Fi on the Arm machines (docs/tessronos/09-network.md 9.6.8),
# for tools/ui_run.py with the kernel of make TARGET=_QEMU_VIRT_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1 WIFI=1 and the
# test disk of a KTEST=1 WIFI=1 build: システム環境設定 〈機器〉〈機器情報〉〈ネットワークアダプタ〉
# lists 自動 and the adapters (QEMU: the board's Ethernet, virtio-net, in use); the one to use is
# the row chosen in the list (自動 at 420,396, 有線 below it at 420,413), set with 設定 (609,554):
# the machine's setting NET_ADAPTER is written as eth and the system takes it. The row chosen is
# left a while first, the page being read again every second, and must still be the one set. A
# row is chosen only after the page says that it lists the adapter (sysenv: adapters 1), not
# while the list holds 自動 alone.
# Then ネットワーク設定's 〈Ｗｉ－Ｆｉ〉 (437,163) and its 〈状態〉 (275,190) say that the machine has
# no Wi-Fi, with their parts not to be worked. The same as the x64 PC's
# (tools/x64/tests/ui_netadp.steps) but for the adapter's name.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
wait 3000
click 270 201
wait 500
click 706 185
expect sysenv: adapters 1
wait 1500
shot netadp_list
click 420 413
wait 2500
click 609 554
expect sysenv: adapter eth: 0
expect net: adapter chosen: eth
wait 1500
shot netadp_eth
click 420 396
wait 500
click 609 554
expect sysenv: adapter auto: 0
expect net: adapter chosen: auto
wait 1000
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 1500
click 437 163
wait 1500
shot netadp_wifi
click 275 190
wait 1500
shot netadp_wifi_state
absent !OACV!
